{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Rude Customer", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Keeping Your Cool", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Food for Thought > Dividing the Chicken", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Being Persuasive", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you work in a restaurant or a shop, it is important to be persuasive to be able to change a customer's mind about something.<br><br>Remember to be polite and use appropriate expressions to persuade someone.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think ... ?</span> , <span class=\"italic\">Don't you agree ... ?</span>  or <span class=\"italic\"> ... if you see what I mean</span> to convince or persuade someone to change their minds.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">would rather</span> to suggest what is necessary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Can't the chef change my menu? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: I'm awfully sorry, but the chef is very proud of his work, <span class=\"strong\">if you see what I mean</span>.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Don't you agree that we should leave soon?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here, \"Don't you agree\" politely persuades someone to leave. The use of \"should\" suggests that leaving is necessary. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Offering Advice and Solutions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you work in a restaurant or in a shop, it is important to offer advice and solutions properly.<br>Remember to offer advice politely and to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to propose a solution.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions:<br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>You might want to ... </li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>You should ... </li> <li>You ought to ... </li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I'm vegetarian. Do you have anything without meat? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Our set lunch doesn't have anything vegetarian. You might want to try some a la carte items.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "set lunch ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a combination of courses chosen by the chef for a fixed price ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our set lunch has a vegetarian option.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear at a restaurant.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Waldorf salad ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a salad with apple, walnut and celery", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Our Waldorf salad is excellent.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "slow-cooked ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "cooked at low temperature for several hours ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should try our slow-cooked beef shank.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "guest ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a patron; customer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: We have a wide assortment of vegetarian options for our vegetarian guests.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "substitution", "type": "name"}, {"content": "change", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I'm sorry, but we do not offer menu substitutions for lunch.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "particular ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "careful about details", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Our chef is very particular about his creations.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "susceptible ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " likely to change to another state or feeling ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our chef is susceptible to bad moods.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to wield ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to use a weapon or tool ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Vanessa wields the knife like a professional.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and find information about customer service practices in 5 countries of your choice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Is good customer service important? Is the customer always right?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How do staff and managers deal with difficult customers? Do happy customers leave a big tip after their meal?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 2 or 3 sentences for each country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your information with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I research information about customer service.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a report on service practices in different countries.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my report aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le05ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Excuse me, I have a few questions about the set lunch. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: Certainly, sir. Today, our appetizer is a Waldorf salad and our main course is a slow-cooked beef shank with mashed potatoes and seasonal vegetables."}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "15800", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: That sounds promising ... The only problem is that I am a vegetarian.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: Oh, I'm sorry to hear that, sir. In that case, would you like to have a look at our menu? We have a wide assortment of \u00e0 la carte items for our vegetarian guests.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>:\tCan't I change my main for something else? I'd rather still pay the set price!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: I'm awfully sorry, sir. We do not offer substitutions for lunch."}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "43300", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: That's not what I wanted to hear! Is there any way that you could check 